        {
          "comment": "Module Structure callout",
          "raw_html": "      <div class=\"lc-callout lc-callout--tip\">\n        <div class=\"lc-callout__icon\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">sync_alt</span></div>\n        <div class=\"lc-callout__bubble\">\n          <div class=\"lc-callout__title\">Module Structure: BUILD &rarr; ENHANCE &rarr; MASTER</div>\n          <div class=\"lc-callout__body\">\n            <p>\n              Each module follows three lab stages. <strong>BUILD (Lab X.1)</strong> introduces a new\n              feature in your game. <strong>ENHANCE (Lab X.2)</strong> extends it. <strong>MASTER\n              (Lab X.3)</strong> polishes and ships it. Carry forward your code from each stage to\n              the next. See <a href=\"https://jfnewsom.github.io/is2053-assets/pages/support/assignment-overview.html\">Assignment Overview</a>\n              for details. Module 5 runs BUILD + MASTER only (no ENHANCE) since Ch11 is dropped.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>"
